{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於十萬廣頌中略出"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727011", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0727011", "type": "mod", "text": "（開府…譯）四十六字【大】，大興善寺三藏沙門大廣智不空奉詔譯【宋】【元】【宮】，唐三藏沙門大廣智不空奉詔譯【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727012", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0727012", "type": "mod", "text": "絕【大】，滿【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727013", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0727013", "type": "mod", "text": "渠【大】，磲【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727014", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0727014", "type": "mod", "text": "一倍【大】，二倍【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0728001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0728001", "type": "mod", "text": "挂【大】，掛【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0728002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0728002", "type": "mod", "text": "及【大】，或【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0727011", "type": "orig", "text": "（（開府…譯））四十六字＝（（大興善寺三藏沙門大廣智不空奉詔譯））十六字【宋】【元】【宮】，（（唐三藏沙門大廣智不空奉詔譯））十三字【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0727012", "type": "orig", "text": "絕＝滿【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0727013", "type": "orig", "text": "渠＝磲【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0727014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0727014", "type": "orig", "text": "一倍＝二倍【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0728001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0728001", "type": "orig", "text": "挂＝掛【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0728002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0728002", "type": "orig", "text": "及＝或【明】"}
